WEBVTT

1
00:00:01,580 --> 00:00:03,580
We agreed before to distribute supplies uniformly

2
00:00:03,580 --> 00:00:07,130
When will the things we turn in be distributed to everyone?

3
00:00:07,130 --> 00:00:09,130
The food rations at home have completely bottomed out

4
00:00:09,130 --> 00:00:11,130
You have to give us a little bit to live on

5
00:00:11,130 --> 00:00:14,570
The supplies that I worked hard to collect

6
00:00:14,570 --> 00:00:16,570
How could it be separated again?

7
00:00:16,570 --> 00:00:18,570
The world outside is in chaos

8
00:00:18,570 --> 00:00:20,570
Only when you have food in your hands can you survive

9
00:00:20,570 --> 00:00:26,260
It’s a pity that I realized now that I was deceived.

10
00:00:26,260 --> 00:00:28,260
He has developed a thick skin a long time ago

11
00:00:28,260 --> 00:00:29,260
Don't care about others at all

12
00:00:29,260 --> 00:00:35,680
Grandma keeps thinking about her cell phone

13
00:00:35,680 --> 00:00:36,680
bunch of idiots

14
00:00:36,680 --> 00:00:37,680
Live Agai was red

15
00:00:37,680 --> 00:00:38,680
How can I distribute the supplies when I have them?

16
00:00:38,680 --> 00:00:40,680
Aunt Lin collected the supplies for the entire building

17
00:00:40,680 --> 00:00:41,680
This man, Zheng Yanshun, asked him for it.

18
00:00:41,680 --> 00:00:43,680
Even if there was a commotion afterwards, he would still be ashamed

19
00:00:43,680 --> 00:00:44,680
There are many of us

20
00:00:44,680 --> 00:00:46,680
It would be better to have more food stored for the winter
